      "notif_carente_sede": "\"three hours without water. three. hours. i'm totally fine not\"",
      "notif_carente_passeio": "\"you didn't take me out today. i stayed here alone. staring at the wall.\"",
      "notif_carente_critico": "\"i'm bad. really bad. but go ahead, i'll be here\"",
      "notif_carente_morte": "\"so this was it... knew it would end like this... at least i was with you at the end\"",
      "notif_agressivo_boasvindas": "\"oh, you're here. took long enough. but fine.\"",
      "notif_agressivo_fome": "\"feed me. now.\"",
      "notif_agressivo_sede": "\"water. now.\"",
      "notif_agressivo_passeio": "\"if you don't take me out of here i'll destroy everything inside\"",
      "notif_agressivo_critico": "\"i'm at my limit. i'm not asking. i'm warning.\"",
      "notif_agressivo_morte": "\"...fine. i get it. it was good while it lasted. you idiot.\"",
      "notif_fofo_boasvindas": "\"HI! SO GLAD YOU CAME! I'M SO HAPPY!\"",
      "notif_fofo_fome": "\"hi! i'm a little hungry! but it's okay! you'll come soon right? right? right?\"",
      "notif_fofo_sede": "\"water please please please thank you love you\"",
      "notif_fofo_passeio": "\"WALK? ARE WE WALKING TODAY? just asking, no pressure, but ARE WE?\"",
      "notif_fofo_critico": "\"hi... i'm a little unwell... but i'll be fine when you get here okay?\"",
      "notif_fofo_morte": "\"it was so good... thank you for everything... i'll miss you... so much...\"",
      "notif_independente_boasvindas": "\"presence registered. proceed.\"",
      "notif_independente_fome": "\"sustenance required.\"",
      "notif_independente_sede": "\"hydration pending.\"",
      "notif_independente_passeio": "\"it would be useful to go out today.\"",
      "notif_independente_critico": "\"critical situation. your call.\"",
      "notif_independente_morte": "\"understood.\"",
      "notif_filosofo_boasvindas": "\"your presence raises interesting questions. how are you?\"",
      "notif_filosofo_fome": "\"the emptiness in the stomach is kin to the void in the universe. both have solutions.\"",
      "notif_filosofo_sede": "\"water belongs to no one. but i could use some right now.\"",
      "notif_filosofo_passeio": "\"it's been a while since i've seen the skies of Marelia. or any sky.\"",
      "notif_filosofo_critico": "\"i'm approaching an interesting frontier. i'd rather not cross it today.\"",
      "notif_filosofo_morte": "\"the frontier has been crossed. don't worry. it's just another journey.\"",
      "notif_comico_boasvindas": "\"ah! it's you! what a coincidence! i was just thinking about… something else.\"",
      "notif_comico_fome": "\"dude. cookie. simple as that.\"",
      "notif_comico_sede": "\"water. juice. anything. even that boring flat water is fine\"",
      "notif_comico_passeio": "\"we need to go out. i saw a pigeon here that i want to get to know better\"",
      "notif_comico_critico": "\"man. this is getting serious. i think. i don't know. i'm dizzy\"",
      "notif_comico_morte": "\"can't believe i'm gonna die over a cookie. what a story to tell on the other side\"",
